e with some the report also  suggests FBI agent Peter struck who  helped lead both the Clinton and Russia  investigation may have acted improperly  in August 2016 top FBI lawyer Lisa Paige  texted struck asking Trump's not ever  going to become president right right  - which struck replied no no he's not  we'll stop it White House press  secretary Sarah Sanders responded to the  report it reaffirmed their president  suspicions about commis conduct and the  political bias among some of the members  of the FBI and President Trump responded  the report this morning in a tweet  saying about the text between Paige and  struck that quote doesn't get any lower  than that  the report also found ironically that  former FBI director James Comey used a  private Gmail account to conduct  official FBI business that is of course  contrary to FBI policy in a tweet  Hillary Clinton responded to that  jokingly saying quote but my emails  Gail that she doesn't think that's quite  a joke thank you very much Jeff McGee's  reporting from Washington
 

